    "chunk_text": "a, and on geswincum He moste \u00fea warnian wi\u00f0 w\u00e6ter and wi\u00f0 fyr, and behealdan w\u00e6rlice \u00fe\u00e6t he hearde ne feolle, and mid Eac swylce seo sunne, and so\u00f0lice se mona wurdon ben\u00e6mde heora wynsuman beorhtnysse \u00e6fter Be seofonfealdan w\u00e6s seo sunne \u00fea beorhtre \u00e6r\u00feam se mann agylte, and se mona h\u00e6fde \u00fe\u00e6re sunnan Hi sceolan eft swa\u00feeah \u00e6fter domesd\u00e6ge habban be fullan heora beorhtnysse, be \u00feam \u00fee hy gesceapene Menn magon eac geearnian mid micelre earfo\u00f0nysse \u00fe\u00e6t hi wunian mid gode on wynsumnysse \u00e6fre Nu ne r\u00e6de we on bocum \u00fe\u00e6t man ar\u00e6rde h\u00e6\u00feengyld on eallum \u00feam fyrste \u00e6r noes flode, o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea \u00d0a \u00fea hi toferdon to fyrlenum landum, and mancynn \u00fea weox, \u00fea wurdon hi bep\u00e6hte \u00feurh \u00feone ealdan Hi namon \u00fea to wisdome \u00fe\u00e6t hi wur\u00feodon him for godas \u00fea sunnan and \u00feone monan, for heora Sume menn eac s\u00e6don be \u00feam scinendum steorrum \u00fe\u00e6t hi godas w\u00e6ron, and wur\u00feodan hy georne. Sume hi gelyfdon on fyr for his f\u00e6rlicum bryne, sume eac on w\u00e6ter, and wur\u00f0odan hi for godas; sume Ac hi mihton tocnawan, gif hi cu\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t gescead, \u00fe\u00e6t se is ana god \u00fee hi ealle gesceop, us mannum to \u00deas gesceafta do\u00f0 swa swa hym gedihte heora scyppend, and ne magon naht don butan drihtnes",
